[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726776369","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103932#issuecomment-2726776369","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103932","id":2726776369,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ih04x","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T16:42:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T16:42:58Z","body":"> I really like the core idea, but I'm not sure why we're opting for a separate header/namespace over methods within `Span` itself. Everything so far uses `Span` as the first argument, and based off the name I imagine that'll be the case for the overwhelming majority of functions, so separating them feels like unnecessary bloat. Even if certain functions don't need to be scoped under `Span`, the convention is generally to have accompanying classes/functions within the same file (`Variant` being the only real exception thanks to its insane size), so that code should all be in `span.h` regardless.\r\n\r\nTbh., I also kind of dislike needing the `Spans::func(span, ...)` instead of just `span.func(...)`. I'd put it all in extension headers if that was possible 😅\r\n\r\nThe reason I was even considering putting them in a separate header was compile times and decoupling. But perhaps that's premature optimization.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726776369/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726805171","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103932#issuecomment-2726805171","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103932","id":2726805171,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ih76z","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T17:24:43Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T17:24:43Z","body":"No clue how much compile times would be impacted—that's something I think needs more investigation overall—but decoupling is absolutely premature optimization; `Span` *s